{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "02d0cc8f-74e3-814f-b056-63fcf4bbc364",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T15:33:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Declan E. Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:29:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa Delgado. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:29:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes. I'd like to report a fox. I saw a fox this afternoon, middle of the day, out in broad daylight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:29:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Where did you see it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:30:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right by my house, 20 Thames Street. It was trotting along the side of the road, then it cut across a couple of yards."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "20 Thames Street, got it. About what time was that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:30:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Little after two, I'd say. I was looking out the front window. I said to my son, come look at this, and he did, and we both watched it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:30:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Was it acting strangely at all? Stumbling, aggressive, not afraid of people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it didn't seem to be in any hurry. It wasn't afraid of the car that went by. It just kept on walking. It looked thin, but I'm no expert."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:30:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Did it approach anyone or go after a pet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. Nothing like that. But there's kids on this street, they're out on their bikes with the holiday week and no school. That's my concern. I called the police station first and the woman said, that's not us, call the city. And I said, well, who at the city? And she said, try the clerk's office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:31:16-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's fine, you're in the right place to start. I'll take down the report and send it to animal control. A fox out in the daytime isn't always a sign of sickness, but if it seems unafraid of people they'll want to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:31:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I figured. I said to my son, that's not right, and he said, Dad, it's just a fox. He's got his mind on other things, he just got braces and he's complaining about them nonstop."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:31:50-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ouch. Those are sore the first few days. Okay, so I have a fox, 20 Thames Street, around two this afternoon, heading across yards, seemed unafraid of traffic. Is it still around, as far as you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:32:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't know. I went out to check about three and I didn't see it. It went toward the back of the neighbor's place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. In the meantime, keep children and pets away from it, and don't try to feed it or get close. If it comes at anyone or looks sick, call the police non-emergency line right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:32:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Should I tell the neighbors?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:32:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, a heads-up wouldn't hurt, especially to families with little kids. Just tell them to keep their distance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:32:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will somebody come out and look for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:32:47-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't say exactly. The animal control officer will get the report and decide. With the holiday week it might be a little slower, but I'll flag it as a daytime sighting near children."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:33:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I have a callback number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:33:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0180."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:33:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0180. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:33:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Declan Dolan. D-O-L-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:33:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Dolan. I've got it all down. If you see it again, call us or the police line and give the time and where it was headed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:33:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
